    "Clear means recorded as clear in the first AI image pass, not expert-certified.",
    "A difference compares the recorded AI reading with the pasted Accordance text; it proves neither side wrong.",
    "Abbreviation point inventories may be incomplete despite clear consonants and are reported separately.",
    "Uncertain readings remain uncertain even if observed positive marks are compatible with Accordance.",
    "Only mark categories explicitly present in a partial reading are checked; unrecorded marks are never treated as confirmed absent.",
    "Secure individual features are reported separately and do not certify whole words."
